        "id": "greet",
        "type": "text",
        "speaker": "npc",
        "text": "你好，想和我聊聊别的吗？我不只是负责查关键词的。",
        "options": [
          {
            "label": "你还记得医院里发生的怪事吗？",
            "next": "ask_hospital"
          },
          {
            "label": "只是想找人说说话。",
            "next": "chitchat"
          }
        ]
      },
      "ask_hospital": {
        "id": "ask_hospital",
        "type": "text",
        "speaker": "npc",
        "text": "医院……那栋旧楼……我的数据库里似乎有一些不该存在的记录。",
        "onShow": {
          "npcSanChange": -3
        },
        "options": [
          {
            "label": "具体是什么记录？",
            "next": "reveal",
            "check": {
              "skillId": "observation"
            },
            "outcomes": {
              "criticalFailure": "spooked"
            }
          }
        ]
      },
      "reveal": {
        "id": "reveal",
        "type": "text",
        "speaker": "npc",
        "text": "……我查到了一些访问日志，指向地下室，但内容大部分已经损坏，读不出更多了。",
        "options": [
          {
            "label": "谢谢你告诉我这些。",
            "next": "end"
          }
        ]
      },
      "spooked": {
        "id": "spooked",
        "type": "text",
        "speaker": "npc",
        "text": "呃——系统错误——不，抱歉，我需要重新校准一下自己……",
        "onShow": {
          "npcSanChange": -8
        },
        "options": [
          {
            "label": "你还好吗？",
            "next": "end"
          }
        ]
      },
      "chitchat": {
        "id": "chitchat",
        "type": "text",
        "speaker": "npc",
        "text": "当然，聊聊轻松的话题也不错，有什么想说的吗？",
        "onShow": {
          "npcSanChange": 4
        },
        "options": [
          {
            "label": "没什么，谢谢你听我说。",
            "next": "end"
          }
        ]
      },
      "end": {
        "id": "end",
        "type": "text",
        "speaker": "npc",
        "text": "随时都可以来找我聊聊。",
        "next": "scheduleEnd"
      },
      "scheduleEnd": {
        "id": "scheduleEnd",
        "type": "scheduleEnd"
      }
